=2 Walkthrough
* NPC asks you to obtain 3 {i:Slug Eyes|Slug Eye|2509}.
** The NPC specifically notes it does not matter how the player obtains it. It can be bought, traded, or farmed.
* Trade these to the NPC and then Report on the quest outcome.
* The drop rate of slug eyes is universally bad for all slugs. It is best if you {p:Despoil} them.
** Using and recalling the {p:Nanaa Mihgo|Cipher: Nanaa Mihgo} {p:trust|Trust} after she Despoils one (to reset the 5min Despoil cooldown) is the easiest method of completion if they are not available on the Auction House.
* Cleaving Slugs in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} works decently as well, there are 11 in very close proximity.
* Alternatively, there are 5 slugs at the northeast of Dho Gates map 1.

